"Change this commit's message" = "Spremeni sporočilo tega commita";
"Commit Messages" = "Sporočila commitov";
"Commit Messages — %@" = "Sporočila commitov — %@";
"Commits not pushed yet" = "Še nepotisnjeni commiti";
"Edit Commit Messages…" = "Uredi sporočila commitov…";
"Edit messages…" = "Uredi sporočila…";
"Edit message…" = "Uredi sporočilo…";
"Files and the working tree are not touched. The old commits are kept, so this can be undone." = "Datoteke in delovna kopija ostanejo nedotaknjene. Stari commiti se ohranijo, zato je to mogoče razveljaviti.";
"Find and replace in messages…" = "Poišči in zamenjaj v sporočilih…";
"Find secrets…" = "Poišči skrivnosti…";
"Find:" = "Poišči:";
"For a secret in a message: the backup is deleted, so the rewrite can no longer be undone; reflog entries that no branch reaches any more go too (commits left behind by a reset among them, stashes excepted); then git prunes." = "Za skrivnost v sporočilu: varnostna kopija se izbriše, zato prepisa ni več mogoče razveljaviti; izginejo tudi vnosi reflog, ki jih ne doseže nobena veja več (med njimi commiti, ki jih je pustil reset, razen stashev); nato git izvede prune.";
"Force-push" = "Prisilno potisni";
"Force-push %@?" = "Prisilno potisnem %@?";
"Force-push the rewritten branches first; then remove again." = "Najprej prisilno potisni prepisane veje; nato odstrani znova.";
"Force-push…" = "Prisilno potisni…";
"Git stored a commit under a different name than expected. No branch was moved." = "Git je shranil commit pod drugim imenom, kot je bilo pričakovano. Nobena veja ni bila premaknjena.";
"In:" = "V:";
"Leave as it is" = "Pusti, kot je";
"Leave this message as it is" = "Pusti to sporočilo, kot je";
"Looks for tokens, keys and passwords in the listed messages" = "Išče žetone, ključe in gesla v navedenih sporočilih";
"Match case" = "Razlikuj velike in male črke";
"Move these onto the new commits:" = "Premakni te na nove commite:";
"No known kind of token, key or password was found in these messages. Search for it by its text instead." = "V teh sporočilih ni bila najdena nobena znana vrsta žetona, ključa ali gesla. Raje ga poišči po besedilu.";
"None of these commits is on a chosen branch or tag, so nothing was changed." = "Noben od teh commitov ni na izbrani veji ali oznaki, zato ni bilo nič spremenjeno.";
"None of these commits is on a local branch or tag, so there is nothing to rewrite here." = "Noben od teh commitov ni na lokalni veji ali oznaki, zato tu ni ničesar za prepisati.";
"Nothing changes yet. Find and replace, or type into the message below." = "Zaenkrat se nič ne spremeni. Poišči in zamenjaj ali piši v sporočilo spodaj.";
"Now" = "Zdaj";
"Now — %@ by %@, %@" = "Zdaj — %1$@, avtor %2$@, %3$@";
"Reading the messages…" = "Branje sporočil…";
"Redact" = "Zakrij";
"Redact them" = "Zakrij jih";
"Redacting fills in the search and the replacement; the list then shows what would change, and nothing is written before Apply." = "Zakrivanje izpolni iskanje in zamenjavo; seznam nato pokaže, kaj bi se spremenilo, in pred „Uporabi“ se nič ne zapiše.";
"Regular expression" = "Regularni izraz";
"Remove old commits…" = "Odstrani stare commite…";
"Remove the old commits from this repository?" = "Odstranim stare commite iz tega repozitorija?";
"Replace with %@" = "Zamenjaj z %@";
"Replace with (empty removes it)" = "Zamenjaj z (prazno odstrani)";
"Replace:" = "Zamenjaj:";
"Still reached from: %@." = "Še dosegljivo iz: %@.";
"Tag %@" = "Oznaka %@";
"Text to find in the messages" = "Besedilo za iskanje v sporočilih";
"The %lld changes:" = "Spremembe (%lld):";
"The %lld old commits are gone from this repository." = "Stari commiti (%lld) so izginili iz tega repozitorija.";
"The %lld selected commits" = "Izbrani commiti (%lld)";
"The branches and tags go back to the old commits — if none of them has moved since." = "Veje in oznake se vrnejo na stare commite — če se nobena od njih medtem ni premaknila.";
"The commit messages were last rewritten on %@. The old commits are kept so that it can be undone." = "Sporočila commitov so bila nazadnje prepisana %@. Stari commiti se hranijo, da je to mogoče razveljaviti.";
"The current branch" = "Trenutna veja";
"The history could not be read. Nothing was changed." = "Zgodovine ni bilo mogoče prebrati. Nič ni bilo spremenjeno.";
"The message of %@ is not stored as UTF-8 and cannot be changed here." = "Sporočilo %@ ni shranjeno kot UTF-8 in ga tu ni mogoče spremeniti.";
"The message of %@ would be empty. A commit needs a message." = "Sporočilo %@ bi bilo prazno. Commit potrebuje sporočilo.";
"The regular expression is not valid." = "Regularni izraz ni veljaven.";
"The remote branches are replaced by the rewritten ones — with a lease: if somebody pushed to them since they were fetched, the push is refused instead." = "Oddaljene veje se zamenjajo s prepisanimi — z lease: če je kdo vanje potisnil od prenosa, se potisk namesto tega zavrne.";
"The selected commit" = "Izbrani commit";
"There is no backup of that rewrite any more." = "Varnostne kopije tega prepisa ni več.";
"This is about this repository only. Commits that were pushed may still be reachable at the server — through pull requests, forks or caches — and in every clone. A secret that was pushed has to be revoked or changed." = "To velja samo za ta repozitorij. Potisnjeni commiti so lahko še dosegljivi na strežniku — prek pull requestov, forkov ali predpomnilnikov — in v vsakem klonu. Potisnjeno skrivnost je treba preklicati ali spremeniti.";
"Undo" = "Razveljavi";
"Undo the rewrite of the commit messages?" = "Razveljavim prepis sporočil commitov?";
"Undone: %@ are back on the old commits." = "Razveljavljeno: %@ so spet na starih commitih.";
"Was: %@" = "Prej: %@";
"Whole words" = "Cele besede";
"edited" = "urejeno";
"in %lld commit(s)" = "v %lld commit(ih)";
"left as it is" = "ostalo, kot je";
"pushed." = "potisnjeno.";
"%@ still has the old commits. Force-push the rewritten branches first; removing the old commits before that would make the force-push impossible." = "%@ ima še vedno stare commite. Najprej prisilno potisnite prepisane veje; če bi stare commite odstranili prej, prisilni potisk ne bi bil več mogoč.";
"A fetch is running in this repository. Try again when it has finished." = "V tem repozitoriju poteka fetch. Poskusite znova, ko se konča.";
"only the newest %lld commits are searched" = "preiščejo se le najnovejši commiti (%lld)";
